2. EN 16931 Schematron rules, CEN validation artefacts 1.3.16
   (rules/EN16931-UBL-validation.sef.json.gz, rules/EN16931-CII-validation.sef.json.gz)
   Source:  https://github.com/ConnectingEurope/eInvoicing-EN16931/releases/tag/validation-1.3.16
   Owner:   European Commission / CEN TC 434
   License: European Union Public Licence 1.2 (LICENSES/EUPL-1.2.txt)
